        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Transitioning to a fully declarative model wasn't without its hurdles. Shifting mindsets from imperative view manipulation to state observation required a significant relearning process."
        }
      ]
