    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "The Verdict"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Building Compose-It reinforced my belief that Jetpack Compose is the definitive future of Android UI development. The reduction in boilerplate, the predictability of state, and the sheer speed of iteration are unparalleled. It allows engineers to focus on crafting experiences rather than wrestling with the framework."
        }
